<mxCell id="l" value="&lt;b&gt;Business flow:&lt;/b&gt; An active QR token identifies an Event. A successful scan creates one Attendance record. Attendance resolves the Staff/Faculty-to-Event M:N relationship; a person may attend an event only once." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="840" width="1210" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
